OL,3,GNEWSAMultimillion-pound hospital
OL,4,Asurgery centre opens
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new surgical centre to help cut
OL,7,Fwaiting lists and speed up treatments
OL,8,Ffor thousands of people has opened at a
OL,9,Fhospital.
OL,11,FThe facility at St Albans City Hospital
OL,12,Fin Hertfordshire has four modern
OL,13,Foperating theatres that can accommodate
OL,14,Fhi-tech robotic surgery.
OL,16,FThe site will be used to carry out
OL,17,Fprocedures including urology, breast
OL,18,Fsurgery, and ear, nose and throat (ENT)
OL,19,Foperations.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
